  "gameData": {
    "backstory": "Born in the grimy back alleys of Subchain City, 'Patch' grew up scavenging for scraps, often patching up his own wounds with whatever he could find. The 'Ouchy' facial scar is a testament to a close call with a rusted DRIP extractor. The Molt Cap hints to a time when he got so desperate he had to disguise himself to infiltrate a prestigious Molting competition to steal DRIP.",
    "class": "Gutter Scavenger",
    "name": "Patch",
    "personality": "Resourceful: Patch can turn trash into treasure, able to craft makeshift tools and weapons from the wasteland's refuse. Cautious: Years of scraping by have made him wary of strangers and quick to assess threats. Loyal: Despite his rough exterior, Patch values loyalty above all else, especially to his companion Stitchy, who has seen him through it all.",
    "specialAbility": {
      "description": "Patch can use his scavenging skills to locate hidden caches of DRIP or craft a temporary escape route. He can also utilize his Stitchy doll as a distraction to lure nearby drones into a false sense of security.",
